nces displayed when clicked.", "width", "600", "height", "228", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_22.png", 1, "my-3", 2, "border", "solid 1px"], [1, "mb-1"], ["alt", "Image shows Comments Icon with Red Dot Indicator to show a comment has been made. ", "width", "600", "height", "210", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_23.png", 1, "my-3", 2, "border", "solid 1px"], [1, "mb-3"], ["alt", "Image shows Artifacts and Documents icon.", "width", "600", "height", "164", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_24.png", 1, "my-3", 2, "border", "solid 1px"], ["alt", "Image shows Artifacts and Documents function with a document attached.", "width", "600", "height", "198", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_25.png", 1, "my-3", 2, "border", "solid 1px"], ["alt", "", "width", "40", "height", "31", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_26.png", 1, "de_780D01ADE8", 2, "border", "solid 0px"], ["alt", "Image shows the Assessment Documents location under the Tools menu.", "width", "400", "height", "347", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_27.png", 1, "my-3", 2, "border", "solid 0px"], ["alt", "", "width", "600", "height", "390", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_28.png", 1, "my-3", 2, "border", "solid 0px"], ["alt", "Image showing the References Icon highlighted expanding the CMMC Source Documents and Help Documents available.", "width", "600", "height", "142", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_29.png", 1, "my-3", 2, "border", "solid 2px"], ["alt", "Image shows Observations Icon highlighted.", "width", "600", "height", "151", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_30.png", 1, "my-3", 2, "border", "solid 1px"], ["alt", "", "width", "600", "height", "323", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_31.png", 1, "my-3", 2, "border", "solid 0px"], ["alt", "", "width", "600", "height", "557", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_32.png", 1, "de_780D01ADE8", 2, "border", "solid 0px"], ["alt", "Image shows Feedback Icon highlighted with comments in text box.", "width", "600", "height", "179", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_33.png", 1, "my-3", 2, "border", "solid 1px"], ["alt", "Image shows the Results tab selected.", "width", "350", "height", "44", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_34.png", 1, "my-3"], ["href", "/Documents/htmlhelp_cmmc/3_2__results.htm", "target", "_blank"], ["href", "/Documents/htmlhelp_cmmc/reports.htm", "target", "_blank"], ["alt", "Image shows the Feedback screen with an option to email.", "width", "650", "height", "425", "src", "assets/images/CMMC/tutorial/drex_cmmc_tutorial_custom_35.png", 1, "my-3"], [3, "page"]], template: function TutorialCmmcComponent_Template(rf, ctx) { if (rf & 1) {
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](0, "div", 0);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](1, "h3", 1);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](2, "CMMC Tutorial");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](3, "div", 2);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](4, "h4");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](5, "Overview");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](6, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](7, "In general, a maturity model is a set of characteristics, attributes, indicators, or patterns that represent capability and progression in a particular discipline. The content of such a model typically exemplifies best practices and may incorporate standards or other codes of practice of that discipline. A maturity model thus provides a benchmark against which an organization can evaluate the current level of capability of its processes, practices, and methods and set goals and priorities for improvement.");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](8, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](9, "The CMMC assessment process provides consistent guidance for assessing a contractor against a specific CMMC level.");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](10, "div", 2);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](11, "h5");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](12, "Cybersecurity Maturity Model Certification (CMMC)");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](13, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](14, " CMMC stands for \u201CCybersecurity Maturity Model Certification\u201D and is a unifying standard for the implementation of cybersecurity across the Defense Industrial Base (DIB). The CMMC framework includes a comprehensive and scalable certification element to verify the implementation of processes and practices associated with the achievement of a cybersecurity maturity level. CMMC is designed to provide increased assurance to the Department that a DIB company can adequately protect sensitive unclassified information, accounting for information flow down to subcontractors in a multi-tier supply chain. ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](15, "div", 2);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](16, "h5");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](17, "CMMC Levels and Focus Areas");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](18, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](19, " CMMC Levels 1 through 3 consist of the security requirements specified in National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) Special Publication (SP) 800-171, Protecting Controlled Unclassified Information in Nonfederal Systems and Organizations. Levels 1 through 3 also include an additional 20 CMMC specific- practices along with 3 CMMC maturity processes for each of the 17 CMMC domains. ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](20, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](21, " CMMC Levels 4 and 5 include a subset of the enhanced security requirements from NIST SP 800-171B as well as other cybersecurity best practices and show that the contractor is capable of reducing the risk of Advanced Persistent Threats. ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](22, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](23, " As a contractor moves toward Level 5, they are required to standardize and optimize process implementation across the organization. ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](24, "div", 2);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](25, "h5");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](26, "Setting the Target Level");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](27, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](28, " The first step to completing the CMMC practice questions is to set your desired target level. If you are unsure of your target level, check your RFI or RFP documents for the required CMMC compliance level for your contract or choose your level based on the following guidance. Additional guidance on CMMC Levels can be found in the CSET Resource Library's collection of CMMC materials. Recommended reading includes the ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](29, "a", 3);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](30, "CMMC Model Certification 1.02 (March 2020)");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](31, ", ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](32, "a", 3);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](33, "CMMC Assessment Guide: Level 1 v.1.10 (November 2020)");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](34, ", and ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](35, "a", 3);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](36, "CMMC Assessment Guide: Level 3, v.1.10 (November 2020)");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](37, ". ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](38, "ul");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](39, "li");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](40, "Level 1: Safeguard Federal Contract Information (FCI)");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](41, "li");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](42, "Level 2: Serve as transition step in cybersecurity maturity progression to protect CUI");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](43, "li");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](44, "Level 3: Protect Controlled Unclassified Information (CUI)");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](45, "li");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](46, "Levels 4-5: Protect CUI and reduce risk of Advanced Persistent Threats (APTs)");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelement"](47, "img", 4);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](48, "div", 5);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](49, "Figure 1: CMMC Levels and Associated Focus Areas");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](50, "div", 2);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](51, "h5");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](52, "Level 1");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](53, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](54, " Level 1 safeguards Federal Contract Information (FCI). Level 1 encompasses the basic safeguarding requirements for FCI specified in Federal Acquisition Regulation (FAR) Clause 52.204-21, which defines FCI as: ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](55, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](56, "em");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](57, "Information, not intended for public release, that is provided by or generated for the Government under a contract to develop or deliver a product or service to the Government, but not including information provided by the Government to the public (such as on public websites) or simple transactional information, such as necessary to process payments.");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](58, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](59, " Department of Defense (DoD) contracts that specify the need for a contractor to process, store, or transmit FCI only require the contractor to comply with CMMC Level 1 practices. There is no CMMC process maturity assessed at Level 1. ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](60, "div", 2);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](61, "h5");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](62, "Level 2");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](63, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](64, " Level 2 is a transitional level. At Level 2, a contractor is not yet approved for CUI. CMMC Level 2 practices and processes provide additional safeguarding above CMMC Level 1 and help to prepare a contractor to handle CUI at CMMC Level 3. ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](65, "div", 2);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](66, "h5");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](67, "Level 3");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](68, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](69, " CMMC Level 3 addresses the protection of Controlled Unclassified Information (CUI). The National Archives and Record Administration (NARA) defines CUI as: ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](70, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](71, "em");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](72, " Information that requires safeguarding or dissemination controls pursuant to and consistent with laws, regulations, and government-wide policies, excluding information that is classified under Executive Order 13526, Classified National Security Information, December 29, 2009, or any predecessor or successor order, or Atomic Energy Act of 1954, as amended.");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](73, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](74, " A CMMC Level 3 assessment encompasses the practices and processes of CMMC Levels 1, 2, and 3. CMMC Level 3 shows that a contractor can adequately protect CUI at the appropriate risk level while accounting for subcontractor information flow in a multi-tier supply chain. ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](75, "div", 2);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](76, "h5");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](77, "Level 4");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](78, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](79, " Level 4 provides increased assurance to the DoD that a contractor is capable of protecting CUI while working to reduce the risk of Advanced Persistent Threats and focuses on the protection of CUI from APTs. It encompasses cybersecurity best practices along with enhanced security requirements from NIST SP 800-171B . These practices enhance the detection and response capabilities of an organization to address and adapt to the changing tactics, techniques and procedures (TTPs) used by APTs. ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](80, "div", 2);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](81, "h5");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](82, "Level 5");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](83, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](84, " Level 5 continues the focus on the protection of CUI from APTs and requires a contractor to standardize and optimize process implementation across the organization. ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](85, "div", 2);
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](86, "h4");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](87, "CMMC Practice Questions");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementStart"](88, "p");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵtext"](89, " The CMMC model measures not only process maturity or institutionalization, but also the implementation of practices. The model consists of 171 practices that are mapped across the five levels for all capabilities and domains. This mapping and the cumulative nature of the model is shown in Figure 2 below. ");
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_1__["ɵɵelementEnd"]();
