        _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_0__["ɵɵtext"](149, ": To aid the RRA user, each question is supported by guidance.\u00A0 The guidance should be referred to for background, possible examples, and for criteria that defines the requirements for a \u201CYes\u201D response.\u00A0 The guidance is engaged by selecting the Guidance Icon containing the letter \u201CG\u201D located below the question.");
